{% if product.tags contains 'Hybrid' %}
<div class="sc-faq-accordion">
  <h2>
    FAQs -
  </h2>
  <div class="accordion-box content">

    <div class="accordion">
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
          <span>1. Is the Hybrid mat suitable for high-traffic areas?</span>
          <span class="icon" id="icon1" onclick="myFunctionactive()">
            <!-- Include the SVG code directly -->
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-body" id="accordionBody1">
         <p>
            -Absolutely! Our Hybrid mat is engineered to withstand heavy foot traffic, ensuring durability and longevity even in the busiest areas of your home.

         </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
          <span>2. Can I use the Hybrid mat indoors?</span>
          <span class="icon" id="icon1">
            <!-- Include the SVG code directly -->
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-body" id="accordionBody1">
         <p> - While primarily designed for outdoor use, the Hybrid mat can also be used in indoor areas too, providing versatility and functionality wherever you need it.</p>
  
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
          <span>3. How often should I clean the Hybrid mat?</span>
          <span class="icon" id="icon1">
            <!-- Include the SVG code directly -->
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-body" id="accordionBody1">
          <p>
               - For regular upkeep, simply tap the mat to remove dust. For deeper cleaning, utilize a mild detergent for shampooing and rinse thoroughly under running water. Though we have tested these mats thoroughly and proudly claim it does not really need a deep cleaning unless very essential.

          </p>
  
        </div>
      </div>
    
    
  
      <!-- Add more accordion items as needed -->
  
  
  
    </div>
  </div>
  
</div>

<!--  -->

{% endif %}

